ect!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " I look for advantages of using clouds for my personal data"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n7le02ob04re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le02ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: May I help you?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: Sure! I am here to report some issues and challenges I&rsquo;ve got with the cloud services.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: I&rsquo;m all ears!&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: Tell me, is cloud computing supposed to be cheaper in the long run?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: Well, this is a very common concern our customers have. At the very beginning, the costs are less, but over time companies may find an alteration and leverage on fees.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: Nobody told me so. What about the flexibility? Aren&rsquo;t we supposed to have flexibility when terminating the contract?</p>"}, {"time": "34000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: You need to take into consideration that the software and data are not in our hands, and you, as users of cloud computing, are somehow handcuffed to your programs.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: That creates complication on the termination of the contract. Anyways, are cloud computing services supposed to be more secure at least?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: Security is our focus when providing software and data storage. However, you need to be aware that our customers are a very attractive target because of the amount of information they have.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: Are you, providers, supposed to update and advance the product?</p>"}, {"time": "72500", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: We have no guarantee of doing so. This is what is called technological edge, but maintaining this edge is difficult and pricey. With some customers we&rsquo;ve experienced a similar problem with the disaster recovery. The issue is that it is tough to corroborate the existence and effectiveness of a system that is probably thousands of miles from our client.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>:&nbsp; I see. So, you are basically telling me that all those benefits your company promises are not true. Right?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Jack</strong>: They are! But you should understand what can resist in those benefits.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rose</strong>: Last question. Are you supposed to tell this information to your customers before going any further?</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}